  "copyright_text": "©Konami Digital Entertainment\nArcade Archives Series Produced by HAMSTER Corporation\n\n本產品由HAMSTER Corporation分發，並已與Konami Digital Entertainment Co.，Ltd.簽訂使用許可協議。",
